WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.006 --> 00:00:27.543
"Oh no!" Cook said.

2
00:00:27.543 --> 00:00:30.789
"I lost my cookbook!

3
00:00:30.789 --> 00:00:33.729
The king's feast is tonight.

4
00:00:33.729 --> 00:00:37.854
I cannot make food without my cookbook!"

5
00:00:37.854 --> 00:00:41.283
"I will find your cookbook!" Tom said.

6
00:00:41.283 --> 00:00:43.557
He waved his wand.

7
00:00:43.557 --> 00:00:47.169
"Have a look! Find the book!"

8
00:00:47.169 --> 00:00:49.531
Poof!

9
00:00:49.531 --> 00:00:52.589
Tom heard a loud bang.

10
00:00:52.589 --> 00:00:55.410
But no cookbook appeared.

11
00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:59.230
Then Dirk rushed into the Royal Kitchen.

12
00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:04.009
"The queen was reading in the library," Dirk snapped.

13
00:01:04.009 --> 00:01:08.286
"And a bookshelf exploded.

14
00:01:08.286 --> 00:01:11.152
Did you do that, Tom?"

15
00:01:11.152 --> 00:01:14.042
"Oops," Tom said.

16
00:01:14.042 --> 00:01:18.254
"We are looking for my cookbook," Cook said.

17
00:01:18.254 --> 00:01:20.815
"Find it!" Dirk said.

18
00:01:20.815 --> 00:01:23.687
"The lords and knights will arrive soon.

19
00:01:23.687 --> 00:01:29.038
The king's feast must be perfect!"

20
00:01:29.038 --> 00:01:32.404
Dirk left the kitchen.

21
00:01:32.404 --> 00:01:38.390
"Help me look, Tom!" Cook said.

22
00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:47.733
They looked all over the castle.

23
00:01:47.733 --> 00:01:53.435
They looked on shelves and under tables.

24
00:01:53.435 --> 00:01:57.406
They looked in the pantry and the Royal Garden.

25
00:01:57.406 --> 00:02:01.692
They did not find the cookbook.

26
00:02:01.692 --> 00:02:08.800
Finally they returned to the kitchen.

27
00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:13.809
Cook clutched her apron. "This is terrible!"

28
00:02:13.809 --> 00:02:16.850
"I have an idea!" Tom said.

29
00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:19.767
"I will make a magic powder.

30
00:02:19.767 --> 00:02:22.968
It will make your food taste good!"

31
00:02:22.968 --> 00:02:26.598
"Please do that, Tom," Cook said.

32
00:02:26.598 --> 00:02:30.685
"I can't cook without my cookbook!"

33
00:02:30.685 --> 00:02:33.710
Dirk poked his head into the kitchen.

34
00:02:33.711 --> 00:02:36.449
"Your spell must work, Wizard!

35
00:02:36.449 --> 00:02:47.435
Or you will both go to the Grim Dungeon!"
